# PSR-4b — API / codegen / product-default neutrality (careful slice)

## Scope

| Work | In this wave | Deferred |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Inventory branded imports in `apps/api/src` | Yes | — |
| Inventory `workspaceType ?? "denali"` product defaults | Yes (2 sites) | Runtime fail-closed |
| Inventory codegen branded scripts (`whyDenali`, …) | Yes | Rename/landing migration |
| List `apps/api` workspace package deps | Yes | Generate from manifests |
| Rewrite host imports / delete configure adapters | **No** | PSR-4b-host-imports |
| Delete Denali exports (−9 host-visible) | **No** | PSR-4b-exports after proof |
| Change required CI checks | **No** | — |

Machine map:
[`psr-4b-api-neutrality-inventory.yaml`](./psr-4b-api-neutrality-inventory.yaml)

## Snapshot metrics (2026-07-31)

| Metric | Count |
| --- | ---: |
| Branded import sites (`apps/api/src`) | 82 |
| Generated | 51 |
| Test | 18 |
| Product adapters (`configure-*`) | 2 |
