## Follow-on slices (ordered)

1. **PSR-4b-defaults** — remove the two `?? "denali"` sites (fail-closed)
2. **PSR-4b-host-imports** — shrink host-source branded imports
3. **PSR-4b-api-deps** — sync `apps/api/package.json` membership from manifests
4. **PSR-4b-whyDenali** — neutral guest-landing section id in codegen
5. **PSR-4b-exports** — Denali host-visible −9 with PSR-4a proof

